1
00:01:37,750 --> 00:01:42,890
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,509 --> 00:01:46,000
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:48,470 --> 00:01:50,120
Then you should get ready

4
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,140
and report to Old Madam tomorrow.

5
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,360
They have already left.

6
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:33,820
Lord Yan,
there is no need to keep up this act.

7
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,150
Fourth Lady, you change your face

8
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:40,750
faster than turning a page.

9
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:43,560
It was you who asked me

10
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,490
to put on this act with you tonight.

11
00:02:45,710 --> 00:02:48,170
I didn't expect to be tossed aside
once used.

12
00:02:48,190 --> 00:02:49,120
But that is fine.

13
00:02:49,430 --> 00:02:50,520
The act is over.

14
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:52,710
Now it is our turn to be the audience.

15
00:03:09,030 --> 00:03:09,960
Concubine Mei,

16
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,180
you have such a vicious heart!

17
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:14,590
I've done so much dirty work for you.

18
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:15,470
What?

19
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:17,610
You want to get rid of me now

20
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,000
and let me die?

21
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:20,520
Get out of my way!

22
00:03:21,310 --> 00:03:24,310
I haven't settled the score with you
for the last time!

23
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,560
Nanny Rong,

24
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:28,120
what happened?

25
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:29,280
Why are you so angry?

26
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,360
When handing over the estate,

27
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,560
you made sure to clean up your own books.

28
00:03:37,190 --> 00:03:38,560
But you didn't help me write off

29
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,360
the IOUs I'd handled.

30
00:03:40,710 --> 00:03:41,960
Isn't it obvious?

31
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:45,340
You wanted me to take the blame
if something goes wrong!

32
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,400
Nanny Rong.

33
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:50,240
How do you get more stupid
as you get older?

34
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:53,150
You don't even know
your place as a servant.

35
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:54,870
Do you expect

36
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,360
me, your master,

37
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,520
to do things for you?

38
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:02,640
But the money collected
didn't go into my pocket.

39
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,080
Don't worry.

40
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:08,190
Qingyuan can't deal with
the tenants' disturbance.

41
00:04:08,190 --> 00:04:09,710
Once Old Madam blames her,

42
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:11,710
she won't even be able to save herself.

43
00:04:11,710 --> 00:04:13,710
She won't have time to deal with you.

44
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:14,800
Besides,

45
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:17,610
the Master will return home soon.

46
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:20,070
We just need to lay low for a few days.

47
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:22,390
I am in charge of this family.

48
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:24,680
With me here,

49
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:26,450
what are you afraid of?

50
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:30,390
I was desperate and spoke out of turn.

51
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,240
You may leave.

52
00:04:52,950 --> 00:04:54,120
This sly servant...

53
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:56,870
probably can't be kept anymore.

54
00:04:57,510 --> 00:04:58,240
Chuntai.

55
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,920
Yes, Second Madam.

56
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,510
Once Nanny Rong

57
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:13,870
is handed over to the authorities
and executed,

58
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,600
there will be no evidence left.

59
00:05:16,390 --> 00:05:17,310
By then,

60
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:19,430
Concubine Mei's name will be cleared.

61
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:21,270
You will also have uncovered the truth.

62
00:05:21,270 --> 00:05:22,530
Move! Get out of my way!

63
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:24,270
Don't worry.

64
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:27,240
Qingyuan can't deal with
the tenants' disturbance.

65
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:29,040
Once Old Madam blames her,

66
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:30,750
she won't even be able to save herself.

67
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:32,750
She won't have time to deal with you.

68
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,630
Then you should get ready

69
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:37,659
and report to Old Madam tomorrow.

70
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:41,310
No.

71
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,560
To survive,

72
00:05:44,390 --> 00:05:45,720
I have to go to Old Madam.

73
00:05:50,390 --> 00:05:51,390
Old Madam is here!

74
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:52,530
Step aside!

75
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:53,610
Step aside!

76
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:56,230
The person in charge is here?

77
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,630
This is the old madam of the Xie family.

78
00:05:58,630 --> 00:05:59,120
Right!

79
00:05:59,390 --> 00:06:01,010
Pay us back!

80
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,740
Pay us back!

81
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,510
Pay us back!

82
00:06:14,670 --> 00:06:17,230
Pay us back! Pay us back!

83
00:06:17,250 --> 00:06:18,750
-Grandmother?
-Give us an answer today!

84
00:06:18,750 --> 00:06:19,920
Give us an answer today!

85
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:22,090
Pay us back! Pay us back!

86
00:06:22,110 --> 00:06:24,950
Pay us back! Pay us back!

87
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,180
Greetings, Grandmother.

88
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:28,630
What brings you here?

89
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:32,000
You've only been in charge of the estate
for a few days,

90
00:06:32,270 --> 00:06:34,600
yet you've already caused such a huge mess

91
00:06:34,630 --> 00:06:36,760
that the entire estate is surrounded.

92
00:06:36,830 --> 00:06:37,830
I don't even know

93
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:40,510
if you still respect me

94
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:42,270
as your grandmother.

95
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:45,990
Grandmother.

96
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,270
It is my fault

97
00:06:47,510 --> 00:06:49,040
for disturbing your peace.

98
00:06:49,190 --> 00:06:50,240
I just wanted to

99
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,000
fill the deficit in the accounts first

100
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,830
and then report to you

101
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,310
after settling the matter.

102
00:06:55,310 --> 00:06:56,370
But I didn't expect

103
00:06:57,270 --> 00:06:58,470
you to come in person.

104
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,600
Please calm down, Old Madam.

105
00:07:01,870 --> 00:07:03,160
Fourth Lady

106
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,070
has only been home for a few months.

107
00:07:05,070 --> 00:07:07,390
How could she cause such a big mess?

108
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,310
Old Madam!

109
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,630
Stop her!

110
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:13,750
Move!

111
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:16,270
Do you even know who I am? Blocking me?

112
00:07:16,270 --> 00:07:16,950
Old Madam!

113
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,160
Old Madam!

114
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:19,600
What are you doing here?

115
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,920
Yelling and shouting.

116
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,040
What a disgrace.

117
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,630
Old Madam!

118
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:28,190
I am guilty.

119
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,430
Please,

120
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,310
let me die in the Xie Residence.

121
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:32,950
Don't send me to the government office!

122
00:07:32,950 --> 00:07:34,150
You old woman,

123
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:36,490
what nonsense are you talking about?

124
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,800
I knew nothing about

125
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,310
the usury at the estate!

126
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,740
But the Fourth Lady

127
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,630
wants to plant this

128
00:07:45,950 --> 00:07:48,040
on me.

129
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,720
You...

130
00:07:51,150 --> 00:07:52,070
Qingyuan,

131
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:53,750
is this true?

132
00:07:55,950 --> 00:07:56,750
Grandmother.

133
00:07:57,150 --> 00:07:59,240
After I took over the estate,

134
00:07:59,430 --> 00:08:00,630
I found IOUs that Nanny Rong had handled

135
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:02,800
in the storehouse.

136
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,240
So I deliberately

137
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,480
sprinkled sappanwood powder there,

138
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,430
waiting for

139
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:09,360
someone to steal the evidence.

140
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:10,120
As expected,

141
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:12,310
the IOUs disappeared last night.

142
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,430
So,

143
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:16,870
it must have been Nanny Rong
who stole them.

144
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,330
I didn't expect Nanny Rong

145
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,720
to come here and cry for injustice today.

146
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,520
Grandmother,

147
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,980
just splash alum water

148
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:24,070
on her soles,

149
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,600
and the sappanwood powder will turn red.

150
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,510
Then,

151
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,180
everything will be clear.

152
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:35,360
Servants!

153
00:08:35,510 --> 00:08:36,000
Yes!

154
00:08:38,549 --> 00:08:39,909
Men and women should keep their distance!

155
00:08:39,909 --> 00:08:40,669
How improper!

156
00:08:40,669 --> 00:08:41,630
How improper!

157
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,490
You damn slave!

158
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,380
Let go of me!

159
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,320
Let go of me!

160
00:08:45,390 --> 00:08:46,520
Give me back my shoe!

161
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,330
Put it there!

162
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,030
It's...

163
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:14,840
Look carefully.

164
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:17,480
What else do you have to say?

165
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,390
Tell me the truth!

166
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,240
I'll talk.

167
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:33,870
I'll talk.

168
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:36,320
This

169
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:39,640
has nothing to do with the Fourth Lady.

170
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,620
It's the Second Madam!

171
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,980
It's the Second Madam!

172
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,980
She ordered me to engage in usury,

173
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:52,120
but something went wrong.

174
00:09:52,550 --> 00:09:53,790
The money lent out

175
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,390
couldn't be collected.

176
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:58,470
This led to a deficit
in the estate's accounts.

177
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,750
Somehow,

178
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:02,630
the tenants outside got the news.

179
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,750
They were afraid
they wouldn't get their wages,

180
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:06,610
so they gathered to make trouble.

181
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:08,870
Seeing what happened, the Second Madam

182
00:10:09,390 --> 00:10:11,150
passed the buck

183
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,670
to the Fourth Lady!

184
00:10:17,150 --> 00:10:18,360
How bold!

185
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,910
Every word I said is true!

186
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:21,440
It was all ordered by the Second Madam.

187
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,850
I didn't dare to disobey!

188
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:25,630
I wanted to live, Old Madam!

189
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:30,030
Good.

190
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,270
Good.

191
00:10:32,790 --> 00:10:34,030
Mei Yinghua,

192
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:37,480
I'd like to see
how big your appetite really is.

193
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:40,720
Qingyuan.

194
00:10:41,910 --> 00:10:42,720
Stand up.

195
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,130
What happened at the estate

196
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:49,030
is serious.

197
00:10:49,550 --> 00:10:50,670
Why did you

198
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:53,360
take the blame yourself

199
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,910
instead of reporting it to me?

200
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:55,840
Father has

201
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,450
a spotless reputation.

202
00:10:57,960 --> 00:11:00,020
I didn't want these baseless matters

203
00:11:00,030 --> 00:11:01,870
to tarnish his and your honor.

204
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:03,670
What happened at the estate

205
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:04,790
is complicated.

206
00:11:05,150 --> 00:11:07,750
I am willing
to bear the responsibility alone.

207
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:08,750
First,

208
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,630
sever ties with the usury.

209
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,750
Second,

210
00:11:11,790 --> 00:11:14,080
resolve the money issue
for the tenant farmers.

211
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,510
I am willing to share your burden.

212
00:11:17,490 --> 00:11:19,120
Pay us back!

213
00:11:19,150 --> 00:11:20,760
Pay us back!

214
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:22,190
Pay us back!

215
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,720
Silly child.

216
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:26,270
This is no small matter.

217
00:11:27,030 --> 00:11:30,000
It could ruin your own future
if not handled well.

218
00:11:30,510 --> 00:11:31,240
Forget it.

219
00:11:31,550 --> 00:11:32,750
How can the Xie family

220
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:35,960
let a child bear this responsibility?

221
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,480
Let's go back now.

222
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,600
Summon everyone for me.

223
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,550
I want to see

224
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,200
what they are trying to do,

225
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:48,630
and if they still respect me!

226
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,150
The Old Madam

227
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,080
summoned us here

228
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,320
so urgently.

229
00:12:00,790 --> 00:12:02,830
I'm afraid something has happened.

230
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:04,330
Head Madam,

231
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:06,510
you're so behind on the news.

232
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:07,550
Don't you know?

233
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,720
Ever since Qingyuan

234
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,510
has been managing the estate,

235
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,320
such a big mess has occurred.

236
00:12:15,030 --> 00:12:16,270
When I was there,

237
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,000
there was never such a big mess.

238
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:20,180
Old Madam Xie has arrived!

239
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,600
Why the noise?

240
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,240
Looks like

241
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:29,830
someone has been intentionally

242
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,920
making things difficult for me.

243
00:12:42,150 --> 00:12:45,150
I went to the estate today

244
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:48,760
and discovered the scandal of usury.

245
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,840
If it weren't for
Qingyuan's quick thinking,

246
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:55,030
I wouldn't have known we'd been keeping
such a sly servant.

247
00:12:56,150 --> 00:12:58,030
Since everyone is here,

248
00:12:58,390 --> 00:13:00,030
I will ask some questions.

249
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,370
Secretly engaging in usury

250
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:04,930
disgraced the Xie family's reputation.

251
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,730
According to the family rules,

252
00:13:07,750 --> 00:13:09,080
what is the punishment?

253
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,940
Forty strokes of the cane.

254
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:22,720
What audacity.

255
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:25,200
An old servant daring to do such a thing.

256
00:13:25,720 --> 00:13:27,750
Forty strokes of the cane
would be letting her off easy.

257
00:13:27,750 --> 00:13:28,910
If you ask me,

258
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:30,720
she should be beaten
and sent to the government office.

259
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:34,380
Otherwise, people might think
the Xie Residence instructed her.

260
00:13:35,390 --> 00:13:36,270
Nanny Rong.

261
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:37,930
First Madam.

262
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,390
Everyone is here.

263
00:13:39,910 --> 00:13:40,960
Tell us exactly

264
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:42,720
what happened.

265
00:13:44,510 --> 00:13:45,360
Old Madam.

266
00:13:45,870 --> 00:13:47,240
Secretly engaging in usury

267
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,870
is truly shocking.

268
00:13:48,870 --> 00:13:50,550
I have been worrying about this

269
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:51,910
these past few days.

270
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:54,720
Fortunately, I just found a witness,

271
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:57,870
so I brought him here to answer to you.

272
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,000
What witness?

273
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,600
Bring him up.

274
00:14:18,510 --> 00:14:19,840
I am...

275
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,080
Xue San.

276
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,860
Greetings, Old Madam.

277
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:24,200
Who is this?

278
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,910
Nowadays, can just anyone

279
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:29,510
be brought before me?

280
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,320
Old Madam, please wait a moment.

281
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,920
The case involving this person
is just too big.

282
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,910
I didn't dare to act on my own,

283
00:14:35,910 --> 00:14:37,840
so I brought him for you to decide.

284
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:44,120
Rong.

285
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,360
Rong, save me.

286
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:45,840
Rong!

287
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:47,570
-I'm San!
-Why are you yelling?

288
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:48,510
Old Madam,

289
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,660
I have never seen this person.

290
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:51,550
You...

291
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,790
don't know me?

292
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:57,080
I'm just a poor man

293
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:58,480
who finally found a patron

294
00:14:58,480 --> 00:14:59,990
who treated me sincerely,

295
00:15:00,270 --> 00:15:02,080
only to run into such a disaster!

296
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:03,510
Rong!

297
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,360
Rong! Turn around and look at me!

298
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:05,960
Rong!

299
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,550
Rong!

300
00:15:06,870 --> 00:15:08,960
Didn't you say you'd take me away, Rong?

301
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,360
What nonsense are you saying?

302
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:11,670
When have I ever known

303
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:13,040
a filthy man like you?

304
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:17,840
Nanny Rong.

305
00:15:18,360 --> 00:15:20,020
With your monthly allowance,

306
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:24,440
how could you afford to keep a gigolo?

307
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:26,550
-Old Madam, I promise...
-Yes!

308
00:15:27,550 --> 00:15:29,210
I didn't know at first either.

309
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,750
Until one time,

310
00:15:31,150 --> 00:15:32,320
when she was drunk,

311
00:15:32,440 --> 00:15:33,390
she let it slip.

312
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:34,980
That's when I found out

313
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:37,200
that the gold, silver,
and jade she gave me,

314
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,080
as well as the money
she used to buy my freedom,

315
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,510
were all profits she made from usury

316
00:15:40,510 --> 00:15:42,150
using funds

317
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:43,410
from the estate!

318
00:15:43,810 --> 00:15:45,600
For years, relying on usury,

319
00:15:45,600 --> 00:15:48,390
she has been throwing her weight around
in Lan Alley.

320
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:49,200
It's said that

321
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:52,000
she once met a concubine
who had left the residence,

322
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:54,130
and she dared to whip her in the street.

323
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:56,750
Nanny Rong,

324
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:58,240
you are so vicious!

325
00:15:58,510 --> 00:16:00,770
To actually whip my mother in the street!

326
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:02,920
Grandmother,

327
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,670
please seek justice for my mother.

328
00:16:04,670 --> 00:16:05,390
Good child,

329
00:16:05,910 --> 00:16:06,870
get up first.

330
00:16:11,390 --> 00:16:12,270
Old Madam!

331
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,200
I am just a servant.

332
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:16,360
I really dare not take such a great blame.

333
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,760
The whole usury business

334
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:19,880
was on Concubine Mei's orders!

335
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,440
For years, she's been using these things

336
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,960
as leverage to blackmail me,

337
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:25,720
making me do
shady and dirty things for her!

338
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:28,080
Me?

339
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,440
What dirty things did I make you do?

340
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:34,150
You crazy woman, are you out of your mind?

341
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,080
Nanny Rong,

342
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,530
all these years,

343
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:38,630
I haven't treated you badly, have I?

344
00:16:38,630 --> 00:16:40,840
Why are you throwing dirty water at me

345
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:44,150
when you are at death's door?

346
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,510
At death's door?

347
00:16:49,870 --> 00:16:51,730
Since you say I'm at death's door,

348
00:16:51,870 --> 00:16:53,390
I will expose all the dirty things

349
00:16:53,390 --> 00:16:54,360
you've done!

350
00:16:54,510 --> 00:16:55,360
Nonsense!

351
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:56,630
You ghoul!

352
00:16:56,670 --> 00:16:58,000
Haven't you humiliated me enough

353
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,340
all these years?

354
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:09,069
San!

355
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,440
You hit me?

356
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:15,589
And you still claim
there's nothing between you two?

357
00:17:15,589 --> 00:17:17,109
I will ask one last time.

358
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,810
About what happened at the estate,

359
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:22,910
was it Second Madam's order?

360
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,550
It was her!

361
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,880
She did it all by herself.

362
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:32,570
Second Madam didn't know.

363
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:40,590
It's you!

364
00:17:42,130 --> 00:17:44,030
You bought him off

365
00:17:44,350 --> 00:17:47,070
to humiliate me in front of everyone!

366
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,510
I'll kill you!

367
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:53,730
-You ganged up on me with the others!
-Guards!

368
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:56,960
Drag this traitorous servant out,

369
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,960
give her forty strokes of the cane,

370
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,760
and send her to the authorities!

371
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:03,270
Old Madam, Old Madam,
I won't go to the authorities!

372
00:18:03,270 --> 00:18:05,110
Old Madam! Old Madam!

373
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,310
I was framed!

374
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:07,310
Old Madam!

375
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,200
Let go of me!

376
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:09,290
Old Madam!

377
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:10,070
Old Madam!

378
00:18:10,070 --> 00:18:11,510
-You!
-Old Madam!

379
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,400
Get out of here!

380
00:18:13,830 --> 00:18:15,120
Don't you dare

381
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:17,700
disturb the peace of my residence again!

382
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:25,350
And you!

383
00:18:27,070 --> 00:18:27,680
Kneel!

384
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:41,200
Failing to supervise subordinates

385
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:43,160
and ruining the family's reputation.

386
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,560
That is your first crime.

387
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:46,610
Bullying the younger generation

388
00:18:46,750 --> 00:18:48,400
and losing all virtue.

389
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:50,260
That is the second.

390
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:51,790
From this day on,

391
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:54,680
the authority to manage the household

392
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:56,610
will be handed to the first branch!

393
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,920
Since you are in charge,

394
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,720
I hope the family will be harmonious

395
00:19:02,110 --> 00:19:03,480
without any disputes!

396
00:19:07,550 --> 00:19:08,440
Yes.

397
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:18,880
Yes.

398
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,480
First Madam.

399
00:19:22,630 --> 00:19:28,290
[Jingmu Hall]

400
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:25,750
I was wrong! I was wrong!

401
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:28,200
Please be generous and spare my life.

402
00:19:28,830 --> 00:19:30,360
Regarding today's matter,

403
00:19:30,790 --> 00:19:33,000
since Old Madam entrusted it to me,

404
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:34,990
I've invited you all here

405
00:19:35,480 --> 00:19:36,830
to learn a lesson

406
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:38,250
and take it as a warning.

407
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,280
In the future,

408
00:19:40,270 --> 00:19:43,200
no one is allowed to harm the Xie family.

409
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,160
I didn't...

410
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,840
You should also learn

411
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:50,070
to manage your subordinates well.

412
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:50,800
Understand?

413
00:19:51,350 --> 00:19:52,030
-Yes.
-Yes.

414
00:19:52,510 --> 00:19:53,270
Madams,

415
00:19:53,550 --> 00:19:54,680
please plead for me!

416
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:55,920
Nanny Liu,

417
00:19:56,220 --> 00:19:57,070
[Jingmu Hall]

418
00:19:56,310 --> 00:19:56,960
beat her!

419
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,240
I won't go!

420
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,400
I won't!

421
00:20:08,110 --> 00:20:09,880
Second Madam!

422
00:20:17,030 --> 00:20:18,920
The evil you did back then...

423
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:22,010
has brought retribution.

424
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,350
Xie Qingyuan!

425
00:20:38,750 --> 00:20:39,790
Madam.

426
00:20:40,310 --> 00:20:42,750
Nanny Rong didn't make it.

427
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:44,270
She died.

428
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:59,900
When Heaven brings calamities,
it's understandable.

429
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:02,400
But when you bring them upon yourself,
you deserve the worst outcome.

430
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,920
For the sake
of the Xie family's reputation,

431
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:06,590
if this happens again,

432
00:21:07,590 --> 00:21:10,120
everyone involved
will be heavily punished!

433
00:21:13,850 --> 00:21:19,470
[Liuhua Courtyard]

434
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:15,350
That wretched servant!

435
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:16,550
I kept her all these years,

436
00:21:16,550 --> 00:21:19,000
and she actually dared to turn on me
when she was at death's door.

437
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:19,440
Go.

438
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,550
Pick out a good coffin for her,

439
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:24,280
so she won't haunt me
after she becomes a ghost.

440
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:25,740
Yes, Second Madam.

441
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:27,880
Concubine Mei, you really managed
to wash your hands of this, didn't you?

442
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,080
I am truly impressed.

443
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,350
Lord Yan,

444
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:34,110
it's the middle of the night.

445
00:21:34,110 --> 00:21:36,310
You can't be here looking for me, right?

446
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:50,200
Could there be more than one ledger left

447
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:51,700
by the estate manager?

448
00:21:53,550 --> 00:21:54,590
Leave us.

449
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:55,440
Yes.

450
00:22:01,260 --> 00:22:03,270
How did the ledger
of the Xie family's estate

451
00:22:03,270 --> 00:22:04,680
end up in your hands?

452
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:07,210
How smart.

453
00:22:07,310 --> 00:22:08,970
You recognized it at a glance.

454
00:22:10,400 --> 00:22:11,240
Go ahead.

455
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:12,790
Why are you looking for me?

456
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:13,790
Nothing much.

457
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,730
I just wanted to tell you

458
00:22:15,750 --> 00:22:17,550
that your precious son Zhengjun

459
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:19,050
is really audacious.

460
00:22:19,510 --> 00:22:20,790
At such a young age,

461
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:24,350
he dared to lay his hands
on the disaster relief grain.

462
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,400
Lord Yan,

463
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:29,270
you really overestimated Zhengjun.

464
00:22:29,270 --> 00:22:30,600
He has always been dull.

465
00:22:30,750 --> 00:22:33,110
He doesn't have the brain to do this.

466
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:35,720
Yes, he doesn't,

467
00:22:36,510 --> 00:22:37,570
but he has the guts.

468
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:40,440
Do you want me to read

469
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:41,790
every single thing in this ledger

470
00:22:41,790 --> 00:22:42,550
to you one by one?

471
00:22:42,550 --> 00:22:43,310
No need.

472
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:52,720
But rest assured, Concubine Mei.

473
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,440
This case can be big or small.

474
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:57,280
It's not that
there is no room for maneuver.

475
00:22:57,480 --> 00:23:00,080
It just depends on
how much sincerity you show.

476
00:23:01,310 --> 00:23:02,440
How much do you want?

477
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:03,210
Not much.

478
00:23:03,830 --> 00:23:04,920
Just 5,000 taels.

479
00:23:07,970 --> 00:23:09,080
[Virtues Always Prevail]

480
00:23:08,070 --> 00:23:09,600
-Listen to me!
-Pay us back! Pay us back!

481
00:23:09,600 --> 00:23:11,230
[Treasures Fill the Home]

482
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:12,510
Listen to me first, everyone!

483
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:16,160
Listen to me, everyone!

484
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,110
Quiet!

485
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:18,480
Quiet!

486
00:23:17,850 --> 00:23:19,940
[Treasures Fill the Home]

487
00:23:18,580 --> 00:23:20,220
Pay us back!

488
00:23:20,440 --> 00:23:22,000
Listen to me first, everyone!

489
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:22,830
Fourth Lady said

490
00:23:22,830 --> 00:23:24,070
you have worked hard.

491
00:23:24,070 --> 00:23:26,070
This money is what you deserve.

492
00:23:26,400 --> 00:23:27,880
Please rest assured.

493
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:29,780
As long as our Fourth Lady is here,

494
00:23:29,790 --> 00:23:31,720
the estate won't owe you anything!

495
00:23:31,830 --> 00:23:35,680
Great!

496
00:23:34,650 --> 00:23:37,290
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

497
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:41,140
I didn't expect the Fourth Lady
to actually take responsibility.

498
00:23:41,550 --> 00:23:43,000
Let's go drink.

499
00:23:46,910 --> 00:23:49,260
Lord Yan, you are truly capable.

500
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:50,920
Just by a few words,

501
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,750
you got us 5,000 taels of silver.

502
00:23:54,920 --> 00:23:57,000
Is it enough to cover the shortfall?

503
00:23:57,590 --> 00:23:59,000
I did the math carefully.

504
00:23:59,350 --> 00:24:01,750
There are even a few hundred taels
left over.

505
00:24:01,750 --> 00:24:02,960
In that case,

506
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,260
over 4,000 taels would be enough.

507
00:24:05,750 --> 00:24:06,810
It doesn't matter.

508
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,880
Consider the extra a favor.

509
00:24:10,310 --> 00:24:11,910
Just remember to pay me back.

510
00:24:14,790 --> 00:24:16,000
I must say,

511
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:19,070
your deceptive tricks

512
00:24:19,240 --> 00:24:21,240
are becoming better and better.

513
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,350
Are they?

514
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,400
I did say

515
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:28,030
this is the cover of the ledger
for the Xie family's estate,

516
00:24:28,030 --> 00:24:30,890
but I never said if there was anything
written in it.

517
00:24:32,790 --> 00:24:34,550
Why are you

518
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:36,550
so determined

519
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:38,380
to go after the Xie family?

520
00:24:42,070 --> 00:24:44,130
What else could your Xie family have?

521
00:24:46,030 --> 00:24:47,350
I just want to

522
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,810
make some extra profit.

523
00:24:51,070 --> 00:24:53,160
Now that we are
in a cooperative relationship,

524
00:24:53,160 --> 00:24:55,270
are you still unwilling
to tell me the truth?

525
00:24:55,270 --> 00:24:56,510
Even so,

526
00:24:56,750 --> 00:24:58,350
I don't think what I want to do

527
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,010
has anything to do with you.

528
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:01,510
By taking the estate

529
00:25:01,510 --> 00:25:03,030
and getting rid of Nanny Rong,

530
00:25:03,030 --> 00:25:05,090
both our wishes have been fulfilled.

531
00:25:05,110 --> 00:25:06,680
Shouldn't we have a drink

532
00:25:06,830 --> 00:25:07,630
to celebrate?

533
00:25:08,750 --> 00:25:09,410
No, thanks.

534
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:12,350
I need to report important matters
to Grandmother tonight.

535
00:25:12,350 --> 00:25:13,610
I'll take my leave now.

536
00:25:17,720 --> 00:25:20,440
Have you dealt with
the matters at the estate?

537
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:21,750
Yes.

538
00:25:22,110 --> 00:25:25,160
The accounts
of the 131 tenant families on the estate

539
00:25:25,270 --> 00:25:26,530
have all been settled.

540
00:25:26,590 --> 00:25:28,030
The money has been returned in full,

541
00:25:28,030 --> 00:25:29,560
without a single omission.

542
00:25:29,640 --> 00:25:30,960
In that case,

543
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:33,750
you are grounded for three days

544
00:25:34,000 --> 00:25:36,000
and must copy scriptures 100 times.

545
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:37,030
Grandmother...

546
00:25:37,030 --> 00:25:39,480
Did you think your little schemes

547
00:25:39,720 --> 00:25:42,310
would go unnoticed?

548
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:45,160
131 tenant families.

549
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:48,400
The amount of money involved is huge.

550
00:25:49,310 --> 00:25:51,240
No matter how capable you are,

551
00:25:51,880 --> 00:25:53,720
without anyone's help,

552
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:57,720
how could you have possibly resolved it?

553
00:25:59,590 --> 00:26:00,390
Grandmother,

554
00:26:00,510 --> 00:26:01,510
I was wrong.

555
00:26:01,790 --> 00:26:03,720
I originally intended to handle it myself.

556
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,200
But...

557
00:26:06,440 --> 00:26:07,830
But I didn't expect

558
00:26:08,070 --> 00:26:10,150
Lord Yan to pass by this morning

559
00:26:10,550 --> 00:26:12,960
and conveniently hand me the money,

560
00:26:13,110 --> 00:26:15,270
telling me to use it
to clear the estate's accounts.

561
00:26:15,270 --> 00:26:17,070
I was momentarily blinded,

562
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:19,200
thinking the Xie family's reputation
was paramount.

563
00:26:19,200 --> 00:26:20,720
So I took it upon myself

564
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:22,400
and used it to fill the deficit.

565
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:23,400
Are you saying

566
00:26:23,590 --> 00:26:25,720
Yan Rui gave you 5,000 taels of silver?

567
00:26:27,830 --> 00:26:28,400
Yes.

568
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:30,110
I was wrong.

569
00:26:31,920 --> 00:26:33,310
I think you and Lord Yan

570
00:26:34,550 --> 00:26:36,550
have feelings for each other.

571
00:26:37,830 --> 00:26:38,510
Why not

572
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,780
give your hand to him in marriage?

573
00:26:41,070 --> 00:26:43,070
He's a good match.

574
00:26:43,880 --> 00:26:46,640
A woman is not like a man after all;

575
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:49,510
she must eventually get married.

576
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:51,510
Yes.

577
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:55,270
If a woman can marry the man she loves,

578
00:26:55,550 --> 00:26:56,590
that is

579
00:26:57,510 --> 00:26:59,110
a match made in heaven.

580
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,440
Grandmother.

581
00:27:04,070 --> 00:27:04,960
My mother

582
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:07,200
died tragically outside.

583
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:08,880
I've also spent these years

584
00:27:08,880 --> 00:27:10,830
all alone out there.

585
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:12,920
Blessed by our ancestors,

586
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:15,000
I have finally returned to your side

587
00:27:15,110 --> 00:27:16,640
and felt the warmth of home.

588
00:27:16,920 --> 00:27:19,750
All I wish is to perform my filial duties,

589
00:27:20,030 --> 00:27:22,000
copying scriptures
and praying for you every night.

590
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:23,750
I know not what wrong I have done

591
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:25,920
that you are so eager to marry me off.

592
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:28,790
Besides, I have never

593
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:30,550
in my life met my father.

594
00:27:30,720 --> 00:27:32,450
How could I possibly marry now?

595
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:35,160
Since you mentioned your father,

596
00:27:35,830 --> 00:27:37,310
you should understand

597
00:27:37,550 --> 00:27:38,590
that if Yan Rui

598
00:27:38,790 --> 00:27:40,720
stays in Hengtang,

599
00:27:40,830 --> 00:27:42,490
investigating cases at will,

600
00:27:42,550 --> 00:27:46,680
he will be a threat
to our Xie family in the end.

601
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:50,550
Do you mean

602
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:53,750
I should cater to his preferences

603
00:27:54,110 --> 00:27:55,400
and marry him

604
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:57,400
to appease and win him over?

605
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:04,200
I am old,

606
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:09,510
and I always want
to hear some beautiful love stories.

607
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:12,400
You two are fond of each other.

608
00:28:13,110 --> 00:28:14,590
Why shouldn't I fulfill

609
00:28:15,350 --> 00:28:16,830
this marriage?

610
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:23,270
Grandmother.

611
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:25,720
If you are still wary of me

612
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,980
because of the estate,

613
00:28:27,110 --> 00:28:29,680
you might as well let me
take an oath in the ancestral hall.

614
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:32,030
I only have the Xie family in my heart,

615
00:28:32,030 --> 00:28:33,680
and I only want what's best
for the family.

616
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:34,750
As for Yan Rui,

617
00:28:34,750 --> 00:28:36,610
I have no affection for him at all.

618
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:37,480
Using him

619
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:39,640
was just to solve an urgent problem.

620
00:28:39,750 --> 00:28:40,590
If...

621
00:28:41,270 --> 00:28:43,330
If I were to marry into the Yan family,

622
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:45,350
I'd spend all day longing to go home,

623
00:28:45,350 --> 00:28:47,150
looking like a miserable ghost.

624
00:28:47,270 --> 00:28:49,730
And Lord Yan
wouldn't show me any affection.

625
00:28:50,160 --> 00:28:51,830
By then, even I

626
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:53,760
wouldn't be able to win him over.

627
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:55,440
Grandmother,

628
00:28:55,590 --> 00:28:57,190
if you still don't believe me

629
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:59,240
and think I have ulterior motives,

630
00:28:59,240 --> 00:29:01,270
you can see how I behave from now on.

631
00:29:01,790 --> 00:29:02,850
I willingly accept

632
00:29:03,070 --> 00:29:04,400
a half-month confinement as punishment,

633
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,440
copying scriptures

634
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:07,040
and praying for you every day

635
00:29:08,110 --> 00:29:09,570
to show my determination.

636
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:19,880
What are you talking about?

637
00:29:20,510 --> 00:29:22,310
I meant well,

638
00:29:22,920 --> 00:29:24,590
but you took it so seriously.

639
00:29:25,310 --> 00:29:26,400
It makes me seem

640
00:29:27,680 --> 00:29:29,240
unreasonable.

641
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,510
I just

642
00:29:33,030 --> 00:29:34,560
couldn't bear to leave you,

643
00:29:35,030 --> 00:29:37,000
so I blurted out those words.

644
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:41,350
Since that's the case,
hurry up and get up.

645
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,280
Thank you, Grandmother.

646
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:48,400
You have been wronged

647
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:50,220
because of the estate.

648
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:53,200
It looks like you've lost weight recently.

649
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:54,240
Later—

650
00:29:54,550 --> 00:29:55,480
Nanny Liu—

651
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:57,000
make some ginseng porridge

652
00:29:57,000 --> 00:29:58,400
and send it to Qingyuan

653
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,030
to nourish her body.

654
00:30:00,830 --> 00:30:02,000
Thank you, Mother.

655
00:30:02,680 --> 00:30:04,080
Thank you, Grandmother.

656
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:15,000
Help! Someone is dead!

657
00:30:35,390 --> 00:30:35,490
[Danyue Pavilion]

658
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:37,240
Jin Chunqing!

659
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,530
How dare you poison her?

660
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:41,310
Poison?

661
00:30:42,510 --> 00:30:43,720
I don't know what you're talking about.

662
00:30:43,720 --> 00:30:45,000
You're already at death's door,

663
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,800
and you still refuse to admit it?

664
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:50,160
Who exactly killed Concubine Xia?

665
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:54,070
Why did they kill her and frame my mother?

666
00:30:55,110 --> 00:30:57,310
Xie Qingyuan!

667
00:30:57,830 --> 00:31:00,030
I was just following my madam's orders.

668
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:01,360
If you are so capable,

669
00:31:01,440 --> 00:31:03,570
go find those high and mighty masters!

670
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:06,230
My mother didn't care about this at all.

671
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:08,550
Why was she implicated?

672
00:31:08,830 --> 00:31:10,200
To a place

673
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:12,440
where it's always spring

674
00:31:13,550 --> 00:31:15,480
and flowers are blooming all year.

675
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:19,270
As long as you're with me,

676
00:31:19,270 --> 00:31:20,440
I'll go anywhere.

677
00:31:25,750 --> 00:31:27,680
Right here in the Xie Residence?

678
00:31:28,070 --> 00:31:28,680
Chunqing!

679
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,610
Third Madam!

680
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:30,830
What...

681
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,560
What exactly do you want?

682
00:31:35,400 --> 00:31:37,480
Now that I've made a breakthrough,

683
00:31:38,590 --> 00:31:39,920
I should work harder.

684
00:31:49,920 --> 00:31:50,920
Very good.

685
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:57,800
This color is beautifully done.

686
00:32:05,830 --> 00:32:07,830
Since you're embroidering a crane,

687
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,400
you should use the overlapping stitch.

688
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:11,160
Why are you using the flat stitch?

689
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:12,830
You've been practicing for 3 months.

690
00:32:12,830 --> 00:32:14,430
How can you still be this bad?

691
00:32:15,350 --> 00:32:16,480
Mother...

692
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:17,550
Yesterday,

693
00:32:17,550 --> 00:32:19,400
I copied scriptures for Grandmother.

694
00:32:19,400 --> 00:32:21,070
My eyes were sore from staying up,

695
00:32:21,070 --> 00:32:22,590
so I'm not at my best.

696
00:32:23,070 --> 00:32:23,680
Look.

697
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:26,600
Third Sister's embroidery
isn't good either.

698
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:28,030
You can't even tell

699
00:32:28,110 --> 00:32:29,550
if it's a quail or a chick.

700
00:32:29,750 --> 00:32:30,610
Second Sister,

701
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:31,830
it's a mandarin duck.

702
00:32:31,830 --> 00:32:32,960
You're so glib.

703
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:36,510
This is a birthday gift for Old Madam.

704
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:38,280
How can you treat it as a joke?

705
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:40,200
Madam,

706
00:32:40,590 --> 00:32:42,650
Madam, Steward Liu wishes to see you.

707
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:44,410
Let's go.

708
00:32:57,830 --> 00:32:58,880
Eldest Sister,

709
00:32:59,270 --> 00:33:01,130
your embroidery is so beautiful.

710
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:03,160
Let me see.

711
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:05,320
I also want to take a look.

712
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,160
It's really beautiful.

713
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:09,720
The stitches are so neat.

714
00:33:10,030 --> 00:33:11,270
This gold thread

715
00:33:11,880 --> 00:33:12,880
is rare to see.

716
00:33:13,310 --> 00:33:14,240
So exquisite.

717
00:33:16,070 --> 00:33:17,350
This really suits you.

718
00:33:18,510 --> 00:33:19,400
Second Sister.

719
00:33:20,960 --> 00:33:21,690
Look at this.

720
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:23,110
Grandmother said

721
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:25,640
we should do our own homework.

722
00:33:26,550 --> 00:33:28,830
As an older sister,
isn't helping your younger sisters

723
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,890
what you should do?

724
00:33:30,400 --> 00:33:32,460
Besides, your embroidery is so good.

725
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:33,960
If you don't show it to others,

726
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,110
wouldn't it be a pity?

727
00:33:35,110 --> 00:33:35,960
Exactly.

728
00:33:36,400 --> 00:33:38,200
Eldest Sister, your embroidery is so good.

729
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:39,800
Just embroider another one.

730
00:33:43,200 --> 00:33:44,200
Give it back to me.

731
00:33:44,350 --> 00:33:45,680
It really is beautiful.

732
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:47,520
So beautiful.

733
00:33:47,720 --> 00:33:48,720
Give it back to me!

734
00:33:48,920 --> 00:33:49,920
Give it back to me!

735
00:33:50,350 --> 00:33:51,350
Give it back to me!

736
00:33:51,590 --> 00:33:54,680
-You're actually fighting me for it?
-Give it back to me!

737
00:33:54,680 --> 00:33:56,240
How lively!

738
00:34:03,030 --> 00:34:05,920
You four sisters are really lively.

739
00:34:09,510 --> 00:34:10,440
Grandmother.

740
00:34:11,110 --> 00:34:12,150
Let me see

741
00:34:12,630 --> 00:34:14,159
how your embroidery looks.

742
00:34:24,320 --> 00:34:27,510
The mimicking parrots in Liuhua Courtyard

743
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:30,000
look more lively than your embroidery.

744
00:34:30,630 --> 00:34:32,280
No progress at all.

745
00:34:35,360 --> 00:34:36,159
Grandmother.

746
00:34:36,800 --> 00:34:38,060
Look at my embroidery.

747
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:40,710
This gold thread is

748
00:34:40,710 --> 00:34:42,639
rare to see in the market nowadays.

749
00:34:43,230 --> 00:34:44,480
Not bad.

750
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:47,400
Qingru has made

751
00:34:47,800 --> 00:34:49,800
good progress with her embroidery.

752
00:34:50,510 --> 00:34:51,909
Thank you, Grandmother.

753
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:54,400
Second Sister,

754
00:34:54,630 --> 00:34:56,110
what flower is this?

755
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:58,220
I don't think I've seen it before.

756
00:34:58,550 --> 00:35:00,960
It's a calendula, of course.

757
00:35:01,360 --> 00:35:02,320
Fourth Sister,

758
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:04,000
why are you so ignorant?

759
00:35:05,230 --> 00:35:06,550
A calendula?

760
00:35:06,880 --> 00:35:08,150
But I remember

761
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:11,110
calendula petals are oblong,

762
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:13,400
the outer layer slightly longer
than the inner,

763
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:14,480
and overlapping.

764
00:35:16,230 --> 00:35:17,560
It's a golden camellia.

765
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:22,880
When blooming, the flower is bell-shaped,

766
00:35:23,070 --> 00:35:24,470
mostly single-petaled.

767
00:35:24,510 --> 00:35:27,150
The stamens need to be embroidered

768
00:35:27,360 --> 00:35:31,020
with light yellow and gold threads
to restore its original color.

769
00:35:33,630 --> 00:35:35,360
Shameless.

770
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:38,230
How did someone else's
embroidery hoop grow legs

771
00:35:38,230 --> 00:35:39,670
and run into your hands?

772
00:35:40,440 --> 00:35:41,280
Grandmother,

773
00:35:41,510 --> 00:35:43,040
we were just joking around.

774
00:35:43,670 --> 00:35:44,920
Joking around?

775
00:35:45,630 --> 00:35:48,250
Do you think I don't know

776
00:35:48,510 --> 00:35:50,630
how you usually bully others?

777
00:35:53,070 --> 00:35:53,840
Grandmother,

778
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:54,840
please calm down.

779
00:35:54,920 --> 00:35:57,440
I just saw that Eldest Sister's embroidery
was good,

780
00:35:57,440 --> 00:35:59,040
so I wanted to learn from her.

781
00:35:59,190 --> 00:36:00,760
Learn from her?

782
00:36:01,230 --> 00:36:03,830
If everyone learned from others
the way you do,

783
00:36:04,070 --> 00:36:06,070
wouldn't everyone in the Xie family

784
00:36:06,070 --> 00:36:08,800
become a bully out there?

785
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:15,230
Listen up, all of you!

786
00:36:15,550 --> 00:36:16,920
From now on,

787
00:36:17,070 --> 00:36:19,880
if I see anyone's embroidery hoop
grow legs again,

788
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:22,480
no matter whether you're old or young,

789
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:25,110
you'll be confined
to the ancestral hall for 3 days

790
00:36:25,110 --> 00:36:27,800
to learn from our ancestors

791
00:36:27,880 --> 00:36:31,070
about what it means
to have a sense of shame!

792
00:36:31,920 --> 00:36:32,800
Yes.

793
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:33,920
Yes.

794
00:36:43,670 --> 00:36:44,630
Fourth Sister,

795
00:36:45,110 --> 00:36:47,000
thank you for today.

796
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:48,340
Eldest Sister.

797
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:50,480
Daring to say no today

798
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:52,610
was already a big step forward for you.

799
00:36:55,360 --> 00:36:56,150
But...

800
00:36:57,230 --> 00:36:58,890
I'm still not capable enough.

801
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:02,570
You've already done very well.

802
00:37:03,190 --> 00:37:05,510
If you had

803
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:07,670
a husband from a powerful family

804
00:37:07,670 --> 00:37:09,030
to back you up,

805
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:10,920
and he was also the one you love,

806
00:37:10,920 --> 00:37:13,050
wouldn't it be the best of both worlds?

807
00:37:16,550 --> 00:37:18,510
Among these golden camellias,

808
00:37:18,710 --> 00:37:20,030
the most precious one

809
00:37:21,190 --> 00:37:22,250
is called Lanshan.

810
00:37:33,230 --> 00:37:34,090
Eldest Sister.

811
00:37:34,960 --> 00:37:36,690
You are already halfway there.

812
00:37:37,070 --> 00:37:39,730
The Founding Countess
is very pleased with you,

813
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:42,970
and Young Master Pei
is also deeply in love with you.

814
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:47,760
You just need
to take one more step forward,

815
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:50,690
and you won't have to fear anyone anymore.

816
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,280
Can I really do it?

817
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:53,510
Of course.

818
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,840
You can do it.

819
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:59,150
If you can't,

820
00:37:59,670 --> 00:38:00,630
I will help you.

821
00:38:03,670 --> 00:38:04,530
Fourth Sister.

822
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:08,070
Both you and Fourth Madam
treat me with true sincerity.

823
00:38:08,070 --> 00:38:08,960
Rest assured.

824
00:38:09,190 --> 00:38:10,590
I will truly protect you,

825
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:13,130
even if it costs me everything.

826
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:19,510
But Eldest Sister,

827
00:38:19,960 --> 00:38:21,150
could you tell me

828
00:38:22,670 --> 00:38:24,880
what happened to my mother back then?

829
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:32,740
It's fine if it's not convenient for you.

830
00:38:34,440 --> 00:38:35,630
It's not like that.

831
00:38:36,670 --> 00:38:37,960
I just...

832
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:40,710
don't know where to start.

833
00:38:47,630 --> 00:38:49,760
When Fourth Madam left the residence,

834
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:51,000
I was still young.

835
00:38:51,840 --> 00:38:54,440
I only know she was kind to people

836
00:38:55,070 --> 00:38:57,000
and was on good terms with my mother.

837
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:58,030
In her free time,

838
00:38:58,550 --> 00:39:00,070
she often made toys for me.

839
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:02,330
She was very gentle with me.

840
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:04,110
I've never believed

841
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:06,890
that she would harm anyone.

842
00:39:09,190 --> 00:39:10,150
I also believe my mother

843
00:39:10,150 --> 00:39:12,080
would never be that kind of person.

844
00:39:12,280 --> 00:39:14,010
Please tell me, Eldest Sister,

845
00:39:14,280 --> 00:39:16,480
what exactly happened back then?

846
00:39:16,550 --> 00:39:18,880
Why did my mother leave the Xie Residence?

847
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:20,760
I only know...

848
00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:25,950
that back then, Fourth Madam...

849
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:35,160
Fifth Concubine, what brings you here?

850
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,630
A lowly actress like you

851
00:39:44,030 --> 00:39:46,430
isn't worthy of living in Danyue Pavilion!

852
00:39:50,920 --> 00:39:52,920
The courtyard
was arranged by the Old Madam.

853
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:53,590
Shut up!

854
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:04,450
Concubine Xia indeed died that night.

855
